<div class="product__description rte quick-add-hidden" >
                  <p class=""><strong>Recommended to use </strong><a href="https://17e3e9-2.myshopify.com/products/odrive-s1"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>ODrive S1</strong></span></a><strong> instead.</strong></p>
<p class="">ODrive v3.6 is Not Recommended for New Designs (NRND).</p>
<p class="">Due to supply constraints ODrive v3.6 may come with electrolytic capacitors that are 2mm taller taller than previous versions (10.8 - 12.8mm tall).<br><br>The <a href="https://17e3e9-2.myshopify.com/products/st-link-and-usb-extension-cable?_pos=1&amp;_psq=st-link&amp;_ss=e&amp;_v=1.0">ST-Link</a> can be used to flash and debug the firmware on the ODrive v3.6.</p>
<p class="">SKUs:<br>- 56V with connectors: ODv36-56V<br>- 56V without connectors: ODv36-56V-NTHD</p>
                </div>
              
